    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.43731689453125,
        127.41309356689453,
        337.19232177734375
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.20062255859375,
        526.7632446289062,
        367.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "A budget impact assessment was undertaken to estimate the financial consequences of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.70062255859375,
        527.0914306640625,
        382.84564208984375
      ],
      "text": "adopting targeted NGS for DST after a rapid molecular test for rifampicin resistance, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.20062255859375,
        527.013916015625,
        398.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "replacing in-country DST practice in Georgia, India and South Africa (PICO 2). In-country DST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.70062255859375,
        526.9371337890625,
        413.84564208984375
      ],
      "text": "practice included Xpert XDR combined with phenotypic DST in Georgia and South Africa, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.20062255859375,
        526.9138793945312,
        429.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "Xpert XDR combined with LPA in Georgia over a 1-year and 5-year period. It was assumed that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.70062255859375,
        527.1002197265625,
        444.84564208984375
      ],
      "text": "the eligible RR-TB patient populations requiring DST were 58 837, 8200 and 187 in South Africa,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951894760131836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.20062255859375,
        526.9614868164062,
        460.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "India and Georgia, respectively, and that the TB reduction rate over the 5 years was stable  .  (2)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.70062255859375,
        526.96337890625,
        475.84564208984375
      ],
      "text": "To estimate the impact on the country-specific budget, the economic costs generated by the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.20062255859375,
        315.1507873535156,
        491.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "model were multiplied by the number of patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.2044677734375,
        526.9614868164062,
        515.3494873046875
      ],
      "text": "Results from a 1-year budget impact assessment for PICO 2 are presented in   In  Fig. 2.4.5.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.7044677734375,
        526.9591064453125,
        530.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "India, it was estimated that implementing targeted NGS would cost about US$ 57 130 727",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.2044677734375,
        526.9700317382812,
        546.3494873046875
      ],
      "text": "– slightly lower than the current practice of LPA combined with phenotypic DST, which has",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.7044677734375,
        526.96435546875,
        561.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "a cost of US$ 57 719 097. In South Africa, it was estimated that implementing targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.2044677734375,
        526.973388671875,
        577.3494873046875
      ],
      "text": "would result in a rise in budget to about US$ 27 888 200, slightly more than LPA combined",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.7045288085938,
        526.965576171875,
        592.8495483398438
      ],
      "text": "with phenotypic DST, which has a cost of US$ 26 428 600. Finally in Georgia, where there are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.2045288085938,
        526.966552734375,
        608.3495483398438
      ],
      "text": "fewer bacteriologically confirmed patients, it was estimated that implementing targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.7045288085938,
        526.96240234375,
        623.8495483398438
      ],
      "text": "would cost about US$ 592 221, slightly more than LPA combined with phenotypic DST, which",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.2045288085938,
        199.06939697265625,
        639.3495483398438
      ],
      "text": "has a cost of US$ 568 480.",
